     * BioRecognitionElement → {Enzyme, Antibody, Aptamer, SyntheticReceptor}
     * ImmobilizationMethod → {Covalent, Adsorption, Encapsulation, PolymerLayer}
     * MemristiveElement → {Oxide, Organic, GrapheneOxide, Perovskite, SiNanowire}
